WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(audience applauds)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:03.416
(gentle music)

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:11.580
♪ Just before our love got lost you said ♪

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:15.160
♪ I am as constant as a northern star ♪

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.748
♪ And I said, Constantly in the darkness ♪

00:00:18.748 --> 00:00:20.967
♪ Where's that at ♪

00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:25.967
♪ If you want me I'll be in the bar ♪

00:00:26.754 --> 00:00:31.754
♪ On the back of a cartoon coaster ♪

00:00:32.548 --> 00:00:37.392
♪ In the blue TV screen light ♪

00:00:37.392 --> 00:00:40.974
♪ I drew a map of Canada ♪

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:45.974
♪ Oh, Canada ♪

00:00:46.932 --> 00:00:51.356
♪ With your face sketched on it twice ♪

00:00:51.356 --> 00:00:56.356
♪ Oh, but you are in my
blood, you are my holy wine ♪

00:00:57.252 --> 00:01:01.230
♪ You're so bitter, bitter and so sweet ♪

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:06.230
♪ Oh, I could drink a case of you ♪

00:01:08.123 --> 00:01:09.848
♪ Darling ♪

00:01:09.848 --> 00:01:13.971
♪ Still I'd be on my feet ♪

00:01:13.971 --> 00:01:18.971
♪ I would still be on my feet ♪

00:01:20.407 --> 00:01:22.240
♪ Ooh ♪

00:01:36.412 --> 00:01:37.668
(audience cheering)

